      "Am I learning the exact skills required?",
      "Will my resume get rejected?",
      "Should I add more certificates?"
    ],
    solutions: [
      "Role-based skill mapping",
      "Build the exact skills employers want",
      "A strong, verified profile",
      "Proof of skill, not just certificates"
    ]
  },
  academician: {
    headline: "Am I teaching what industry really needs?",
    image: "images/academician_split.png",
    problems: [
      "Is what I'm teaching relevant to industry?",
      "Am I updating course content often enough?",
      "Where do I find mentorship and industry experts?",
      "How do I stay informed on the latest trends?"
    ],
    solutions: [
      "Access to industry-relevant training programs",
      "Direct connection with industry mentors",
      "Real-time updates on industry trends",
      "Practical insight to align curriculum"
    ]
  },
  industry: {
    headline: "So many resumes. So little real talent.",
    image: "images/industry-split.png",
    problems: [
      "How do I find the best candidate for the job?",
      "Are these certificates real or bought online?",
      "How do I actually assess true skills?",
      "With so many applications, where do I start?"
    ],
